.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.vs/
.cora/
.claude/
secrets.json
# config.json is deliberately NOT ignored here, unlike in the sibling projects.
# It carries no credentials, only the definition of the reasoning measurement
# instrument, which must be identical for anyone who clones the repo.
# See README.md > Configuration and docs/configuration.md.
CLAUDE.md
Projects/
# tests/fixtures/*/ configs (candidates.json, judge_config.json, ...) ARE
# versioned, unlike Projects/ above: they're the manual smoke-test fixtures
# documented in CONTRIBUTING.md > Fixtures. Only the artifacts a real run produces
# inside them are not, so running one for a local check never dirties the diff.
tests/fixtures/*/Report/
tests/fixtures/*/progress.jsonl
tests/fixtures/*/progress.jsonl.bak
tests/fixtures/*/verdict_prompt_debug*.txt